g.co.kr","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":1,"commonsNearby":3,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23"},"hashtags":["sungsimdangdaejeon","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"}]},"summary":"It is a famous bakery that ranks first in sales among non-franchise bakery nationwide. It is one of the most famous places in Daejeon and is the most famous among the three major bakeries in the country. It is considered one of the representatives and best practices of local self-employed businesses, with six restaurants in Eunhaeng-dong dramatically revived after losing competition with the large","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Sungsimdang_2019.jpg/1280px-Sungsimdang_2019.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Sungsimdang_2019.jpg/500px-Sungsimdang_2019.jpg","w":1200,"h":800,"author":"Trainholic","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sungsimdang_2019.jpg"}},{"id":"daejeon_yuseong_spa","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Yuseong Spa","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":36.35516,"lng":127.3449},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"daejeon_yuseong_spa","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":3,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23"},"hashtags":["yuseongspa","daejeon"],"summary":"Wounded soldiers of the Baekje Dynasty are said to have been healed after taking a bath in these springs. Kings and presidents including the first King of the Josun Dynasty, have reposed here.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/%EC%9C%A0%EC%84%B1%EC%98%A8%EC%B2%9C_%EC%A1%B1%EC%9A%95%EC%B2%B4%ED%97%98%EC%9E%A5.png/1280px-%EC%9C%A0%EC%84%B1%EC%98%A8%EC%B2%9C_%EC%A1%B1%EC%9A%95%EC%B2%B4%ED%97%98%EC%9E%A5.png","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/%EC%9C%A0%EC%84%B1%EC%98%A8%EC%B2%9C_%EC%A1%B1%EC%9A%95%EC%B2%B4%ED%97%98%EC%9E%A5.png/500px-%EC%9C%A0%EC%84%B1%EC%98%A8%EC%B2%9C_%EC%A1%B1%EC%9A%95%EC%B2%B4%ED%97%98%EC%9E%A5.png","w":1200,"h":675,"author":"김광인","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%EC%9C%A0%EC%84%B1%EC%98%A8%EC%B2%9C_%EC%A1%B1%EC%9A%95%EC%B2%B4%ED%97%98%EC%9E%A5.png"}},{"id":"daejeon_ppuri_park","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Ppuri Park","category":"park","tags":["nature","photo"],"location":{"lat":36.28519,"lng":127.38838},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"daejeon_ppuri_park","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":3,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23"},"hashtags":["ppuripark","daejeon"],"bestLight":"golden","summary":"A family-oriented park on the far southern outskirts of town. Down by a smallish dam, there are the usual swan boats and the like, but the odd drawcard is the hill covered in stone statues representing local family lineages. Local Koreans no doubt have a great time pouring over these, tracing their roots (ppuri), but to the casual observer it's just a curious, if unusual, collection of modern art.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Ppuri_Uri.jpg/1280px-Ppuri_Uri.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Ppuri_Uri.jpg/500px-Ppuri_Uri.jpg","w":1200,"h":880,"author":"사랑","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ppuri_Uri.jpg"}},{"id":"daejeon_hanwha_eagles","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Hanwha Eagles","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":36.3159,"lng":127.4424},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"daejeon_hanwha_eagles","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.hanwhaeagles.co.kr/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":1,"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23"},"hashtags":["hanwhaeagles","daejeon"],"summary":"The city's professional baseball team. Baseball games are held at the baseball field of Hanbat Sports Complex ex (한밭 운동장 Hanbat undongjang). Express bus #2 passes by it, or it can be walked within 15-20 min from Jungangno station. Various teams play including the local professional team and those of the local universities sometimes on Friday nights. Despite tickets being rather inexpensive, many l","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Dominic_Pianto_003%28001%29_during_EMU_at_MSU_baseball_game_on_May_10%2C_2023_%288716700%29.jpg/1280px-Dominic_Pianto_003%28001%29_during_EMU_at_MSU_baseball_game_on_May_10%2C_2023_%288716700%29.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Dominic_Pianto_003%28001%29_during_EMU_at_MSU_baseball_game_on_May_10%2C_2023_%288716700%29.jpg/500px-Dominic_Pianto_003%28001%29_during_EMU_at_MSU_baseball_game_on_May_10%2C_2023_%288716700%29.jpg","w":1200,"h":899,"author":"Joel Dinda from Mulliken, Michigan","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dominic_Pianto_003(001)_during_EMU_at_MSU_baseball_game_on_May_10,_2023_(8716700).jpg"}},{"id":"daejeon_wv_national_cemetery","areaId":"daejeon","name":"National Cemetery","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":36.36819,"lng":127.29881},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_national_cemetery","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.dnc.go.kr/html/kr/index.html","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":1,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23"},"hashtags":["nationalcemetery","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"06:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"06:00","close":"18:00"}]},"summary":"National cemetery for Korea's war heroes and patriots. It's quite beautifully landscaped and surrounded by a ring walking trail. Dress standards apply.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/%EB%8C%80%EC%A0%84%ED%98%84%EC%B6%A9%EC%9B%90.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/%EB%8C%80%EC%A0%84%ED%98%84%EC%B6%A9%EC%9B%90.jpg","w":1200,"h":1769,"author":"칼빈500","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%EB%8C%80%EC%A0%84%ED%98%84%EC%B6%A9%EC%9B%90.jpg"}},{"id":"daejeon_mount_gubongsan","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Mount Gubongsan","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":36.28389,"lng":127.34049},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"daejeon_mount_gubongsan","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23"},"hashtags":["mountgubongsan","daejeon"],"summary":"Open all year round, no parking facilities. This mountain has 9 peaks and walking trails.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_daejeon_aquarium","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Daejeon Aquarium","category":"other","tags":["family"],"location":{"lat":36.3101,"lng":127.4209},"visitMinutes":150,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_daejeon_aquarium","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.djaquarium.com/base/mobile/sub4.php","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23"},"hashtags":["daejeonaquarium","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[null,null,{"open":"10:00","close":"19:00"},null,null,null,null],"note":"Closed Mon, Tue, Thu, Fri, Sat, Sun"},"summary":"It is the first and largest freshwater fish aquarium in Korea, where you can see various freshwater fish from other countries and decorated fish by theme.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_cold_butter_bake_shop_headquarters","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Cold Butter Bake Shop Headquarters","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":36.32613,"lng":127.42343},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_cold_butter_bake_shop_headquarters","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["coldbutterbakeshopheadquarters","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"19:00"}]},"summary":"Cold Butter Bake Shop is a must-visit in Daejeon for lovers of rich, high-quality butter-based pastries. This main branch is famous for its exceptional selection of Scones and signature Salt Bread, which often sell out early in the day. Located in the heart of the city, it offers a sophisticated taste of Daejeon's modern bakery scene, making it a perfect spot for a premium coffee and dessert break","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_hide_out","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Hide Out","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":36.3244,"lng":127.4251},"visitMinutes":45,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_hide_out","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["hideout","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"}]},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"Hideout is a cafe famous for its cake restaurants in Daejeon. More than 10 kinds of handmade cakes are prepared every day, and lemon cake with a combination of lemon curd's freshness and soft sheets is by far the favorite menu. The spacious interior of the store is decorated with a cute interior, and there are various seats such as an outdoor terrace and sitting area, so you can have a comfortable","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_jelly_fore","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Jelly Fore","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":36.3513,"lng":127.3723},"visitMinutes":45,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_jelly_fore","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://instagram.com/jelly__forever__","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["jellyfore","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"}]},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"It is a cafe full of cute props and Japanese sensibility. There is a variety of pudding and jelly menus, and custard pudding is especially popular. The menu is in the form of a diary, so it's fun to watch. The inside of the cafe is decorated with cute props, so there are many photo spots that are good for taking pictures. Also, you can accompany your pet, and takeout and delivery services are prov","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_keungil_sikdang","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Keungil Sikdang","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":36.38531,"lng":127.35197},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_keungil_sikdang","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["keungilsikdang","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"17:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"17:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"17:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"17:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"17:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"17:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"17:00","close":"21:00"}]},"summary":"Keungil Sikdang is a renowned local dining spot in Daejeon, highly praised for its authentic and hearty Korean comfort food, especially its signature Spicy Braised Chicken (Dak-bokkeum-tang). This establishment is a favorite among locals for its generous portions and deeply satisfying, traditional flavors. It offers visitors an excellent opportunity to experience the robust taste of classic Korean","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_loving_hut","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Loving Hut","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":36.36455,"lng":127.43644},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_loving_hut","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.lovinghut.kr/kr/bbs/board.php?bo_table=restaurants_kr_en&wr_id=46&sca=Daejeon&county=Daejeon&lang=_en","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["lovinghut","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Part of a chain of organic, 100% vegan, new pseudo-religious group-run restaurants. Menus in the chain vary between outlets: Shintanjin's mostly serves rice or noodle based fare, but has a Western-style fake-meat item. Prices typically under ₩5,000, owners are friendly and probably won't try to convert you. Fake-meat can also be purchased to take home. A second outlet may be opening near Expo Park","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_mashinae_main_store","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Mashinae Main Store","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":36.36113,"lng":127.33734},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_mashinae_main_store","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["mashinaemainstore","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"23:00"}]},"summary":"Mashinae Main Branch in Daejeon is a widely recognized dining spot, celebrated as the birthplace of the unconventional and highly popular dish, Kimchi Pizza Tangsuyuk (Kim-Pi-Tang). This unique fusion of deep-fried pork, kimchi, and melted cheese offers a distinctive local flavor profile that is a must-try for food adventurers. It’s highly recommended for those looking to experience Daejeon's tren","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_patisserie_lutz","areaId":"daejeon","name":"patisserie.lutz","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":36.3508,"lng":127.3818},"visitMinutes":45,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_patisserie_lutz","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.instagram.com/patisserie.lutz","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["patisserielutzdaejeon","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"}]},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"Located in Dunsan-dong, Daejeon, the dessert cafe is famous for its cute Kkumdori tarts and a variety of baked confectionery. At the cozy store, you can feel the Christmas atmosphere, and it is perfect for dates as most seats consisting of two people. The signature Kkumdori tarts have citron filling in them for a refreshing taste, and a variety of desserts change with the seasons. In addition, the","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_wolves_and_blue_stars","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Wolves and Blue Stars","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":36.32458,"lng":127.4187},"visitMinutes":45,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_wolves_and_blue_stars","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["wolvesandbluestars","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"}]},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"Wolf and Blue Star is a uniquely themed cafe in Daejeon known for its artistic and cozy ambiance, often featuring whimsical decor and high-quality beverages. It serves as a comfortable retreat, offering various specialty coffees, teas, and delicious, often homemade, desserts. This spot is highly recommended for those looking for a quiet, distinctive cafe experience far from the typical chain store","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_incurve","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Incurve","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":36.3505,"lng":127.4301},"visitMinutes":45,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_incurve","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.instagram.com/cafe_incurve","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["incurvedaejeon","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"20:00"}]},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"It is an emotional cafe with the theme of Luck and Four-leaf Clover, and it is a great place to heal with a clean white-tone interior and various plants. The signature menu, Luck Latte, is topped with sweet white chocolate cream and four-leaf clover to satisfy both visual and taste. In addition, it provides visitors with a special experience by writing a guest book and meeting cute dogs.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_harupang","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Harupang","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":36.35965,"lng":127.34454},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_harupang","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["harupangdaejeon","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"08:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"23:00"}]},"summary":"Harupang is a highly recommended stop on the Daejeon \"bread pilgrimage\" for visitors seeking specialty local bakeries beyond the big names. This charming dessert heaven is celebrated for its unique and visually appealing selection of pastries and bread. It offers a great opportunity to sample the diverse and high-quality baking culture Daejeon is known for.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_mood_beige","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Mood Beige","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":36.35195,"lng":127.37291},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_mood_beige","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.instagram.com/moodbeige_cake/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["moodbeige","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"18:30"},{"open":"12:00","close":"18:30"},{"open":"12:00","close":"18:30"},{"open":"12:00","close":"18:30"},{"open":"12:00","close":"18:30"},{"open":"12:00","close":"18:30"},{"open":"12:00","close":"18:30"}]},"bestLight":"night","summary":"A cake specialty store with same-day lettering, it offers cute and cute designs. Available on-site without reservation, there are a wide variety of cakes available, which are useful when you urgently need a cake. It is reasonably priced, and the lettering service is provided free of charge, making it a perfect place for anniversaries or birthday parties.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_a_bite_of_the_crescent_moon","areaId":"daejeon","name":"A bite of the crescent moon","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":36.3183,"lng":127.414},"visitMinutes":45,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_a_bite_of_the_crescent_moon","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["abiteofthecrescentmoon","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:30","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:30","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:30","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:30","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:30","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:30","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:30","close":"18:00"}]},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"It is a brunch cafe that serves a variety of sandwiches in a cozy atmosphere. This place is a popular menu with sandwiches made with croissants and focaccia, which are baked using fresh ingredients, making it a comfortable place to visit alone. Also, it is possible to order in a group, making it suitable for visiting with multiple people.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_kraze_burger","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Kraze Burger","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":36.35019,"lng":127.37736},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_kraze_burger","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["krazeburger","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"A Korean dine-in burger chain with an outlet in Dunsan-dong, about one and a half blocks west from the main Timeworld intersection and on the north side of the road (backing on to the drinking precinct) and another near City Hall. Noteworthy because the chain has extensive mushroom/tofu options for those who don't eat meat.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_tgi_fridays","areaId":"daejeon","name":"TGI Fridays","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":36.3411,"lng":127.38942},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_tgi_fridays","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.tgif.co.kr/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["tgifridays","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"The obligatory local chapter of the international American bar/restaurant franchise. Has an outlet about 100 m from the Government Complex station (opposite E-mart), but more notable is the one in the Lotte Department store in Seo-gu as it takes up the entire west side of 9F, offering sunset views of the city and mountains.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_work_room_coffe","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Work Room Coffe","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":36.3516,"lng":127.3717},"visitMinutes":45,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_work_room_coffe","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.instagram.com/wkrcoffee/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["workroomcoffe","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"}]},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"As an emotional cafe that offers a variety of desserts and drinks, parfait is especially popular using fresh fruits. Inside, the black tone creates a modern and clean atmosphere, and the photo zone and cute props add charm. It is positioned to be accompanied by pets and easy to use public transportation.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_5_5_dakgalbi_yuseong_sangdae_dong_jeom","areaId":"daejeon","name":"5.5 Dakgalbi Yuseong Sangdae-dong-jeom","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":36.34676,"lng":127.33922},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_5_5_dakgalbi_yuseong_sangdae_dong_jeom","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["55dakgalbiyuseongsangdaedongjeom","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"5.5 Dakgalbi in Yuseong-gu is a highly popular franchise location known for serving some of the best stir-fried spicy chicken (Dakgalbi) in the area. This branch is recommended for a satisfying and communal dining experience, where the dish is cooked right at your table to perfection.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_sung_sim_dang","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Sung Sim Dang","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":36.32745,"lng":127.42678},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_sung_sim_dang","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.sungsimdang.co.kr/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["sungsimdang","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Established in 1956, this bakery has a wall full of past awards and credentials on display, the prices for baked goods are similar to elsewhere and they make their own macaroons. There is a food court upstairs serving typical continental fare.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_hare_hare","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Hare Hare","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":36.35149,"lng":127.39496},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_hare_hare","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["harehare","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"22:00"}]},"summary":"A bakery with a winning experience in an international baking competition. If you buy bread and drinks, eat on the second floor is available. The recommended menu is marked above, so it's easy to choose.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_indy","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Indy","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":36.35472,"lng":127.37986},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_indy","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["indydaejeon","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Indian restaurant on the north side of town. Service may be a little slow for some and their prices are in the higher range. Curry dishes come with free rice or naan. Vegetarian options are available.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"},{"id":"daejeon_wv_vesta","areaId":"daejeon","name":"Vesta","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":36.36721,"lng":127.3805},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"daejeon_wv_vesta","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.vestabuffet.com/index.htm","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["vestadaejeon","daejeon"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"21:00"}]},"summary":"It is a premium Vesta buffet with top-notch dishes, elegant interiors, and five senses satisfaction, presented by 100 professional chefs.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Daejeon"}],"sources":["Wikidata (CC0)","Wikimedia Commons (counts; photos credited per file)","Wikipedia (pageviews; summaries CC BY-SA 4.0)","Wikivoyage (listings: hours, prices, descriptions; CC BY-SA 4.0)","OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL): opening hours, fees, websites"]}